{"word":"antisubmarine","translation":"antissubmarino","definition_en":"Designed or intended to detect, track, or destroy enemy submarines.","definition_pt":"Projetado ou destinado a detectar, rastrear ou destruir submarinos inimigos.","example_en":"The navy deployed antisubmarine aircraft to patrol the coast.","example_pt":"A Marinha enviou aviões anti-submarinos para patrulhar a costa.","cefr_level":"C1","word_type":"adjective","category_slug":"technical","frequency_rank":null},
