{"word":"antitumor","translation":"antitumor","definition_en":"Used to prevent, inhibit, or treat the growth of tumors, especially malignant ones.","definition_pt":"Usado para prevenir, inibir ou tratar o crescimento de tumores, especialmente malignos.","example_en":"The new drug shows promising antitumor activity in clinical trials.","example_pt":"A nova droga mostra atividade antitumoral promissora em ensaios clínicos.","cefr_level":"C1","word_type":"adjective","category_slug":"health","frequency_rank":null},
