{"word":"anuran","translation":"anuro","definition_en":"Any of various tailless, stout-bodied amphibians with long hind limbs adapted for leaping, including frogs and toads.","definition_pt":"Qualquer um dos vários anfíbios sem cauda, com membros longos e corpóreos adaptados para saltar, incluindo sapos e sapos.","example_en":"The biologist studied the mating calls of various anurans in the wetland.","example_pt":"O biólogo estudou os chamados de acasalamento de vários anuros na terra úmida.","cefr_level":"C2","word_type":"noun","category_slug":"science","frequency_rank":null},
